    given-names: "Michael"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hamanakam1/el-hidratador"
url: "https://hamanakam1.github.io/el-hidratador/"
abstract: >-
  El Hidratador is the context expansion and execution staging engine of a local-first AI
  software factory. It turns a dry semantic ticket into wet execution state: expanded
  context, an ordered execution DAG, a narrow sandbox specification, and a routed compute
  profile. It never executes work itself and never accepts work on an operator's behalf; the
  acceptance gate is explicit, the core is standard library only, and every refusal is
  visible.
keywords:
